"description":"One Medical is reimagining the doctor’s office. Our app makes it easy to get primary care for your body and mind right from your phone. Need to schedule an appointment with your doctor? Request a prescription renewal? Get answers to a medical question in the middle of the night? With One Medical, your doctor’s office is at your fingertips, 24/7.\n\nHere’s some of what you can do in our app:\n\n• Schedule an in-office or remote visit in a state where we have offices\n• Get 24/7 on-demand care nationwide with Treat Me Now and Urgent Video Chat at no extra cost\n• Receive reminders for upcoming visits and service recommendations\n• Send and receive secure messages with a provider\n• Request prescription refills and renewals\n• Access your health records and care plans\n• Sync your data with Apple Health\n• Manage bills, copays, and insurance\n• Find offices close to where you live, work, and travel\n\nOnly One Medical members can access the app. Download the app and join One Medical today.\n\nAbout One Medical\n\nWe’re a membership-based primary care practice designed around your needs and your life. We accept most major health insurance plans, including Medicare. Our providers take the time to get to know you and work with you on your health goals, so you feel seen, heard, and cared for. We have primary care offices in many U.S. cities and offer 24/7 on-demand virtual care, so exceptional care is always within reach — from preventive care and mental health to illnesses and injuries.\n\nAll One Medical patients enjoy:\n\n• Compassionate providers who take time to listen\n• Appointments that start on time\n• Drop-in lab services at One Medical offices\n• Referrals to top specialists when needed\n\nLearn more about membership at onemedical.com or ask your employer if One Medical is one of your employee benefits.", "trackCensoredName":"One Medical", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/one-medical/id393507802?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "