"description":"Get the medicine and healthcare you need with GoodRx. Find discounts on prescription drugs including GLP-1 medications like Ozempic, Mounjaro, Wegovy, and Zepbound. Access reliable telehealth services from doctors online. Buy prescriptions without health insurance. Keep track of medications with our medicine tracker and drug guide. Our free digital coupons may help you save more money on meds at the pharmacy than Medicare or health insurance. Our rx app offers complete virtual care and acts as your personal medical assistant.\n\nGoodRx is NOT insurance. Cancel anytime.\n\nDigital coupons app for prescription discounts. Virtual health care with a personal pill tracker, rewards, and medication reminder. Medical insurance benefits like Rx discounts on medicine, senior care, or triage services. Enjoy drug savings with our medical app that is trusted by millions.\n\nPill reminder for Rx savings and coupons, a complete mobile healthcare app without medical insurance. Save your medication list with our drug guide and medicine tracker. Price check prescriptions, save money with mobile Rx coupons, & find a doctor for virtual care.\n\nIf your local Rite Aid Pharmacy has closed, you can still get GoodRx savings at over 70,000 other pharmacies, including:\n- CVS Pharmacy\n- Walgreens Pharmacy\n- Kroger Pharmacy\n- Safeway Pharmacy\n- Walmart Pharmacy\n- HEB Pharmacy\n- Target Pharmacy\n- Vons Pharmacy\n- & more\n\nPrescriptions Up To 80% Off\n- Digital coupons app with savings on prescription drugs\n- Find Rx savings when you search medications\n- Check Rx pharmacy prices & redeem coupons to claim your prescription discount\n- Health app with discounted meds & patient assistance programs\n- Save on pet medications too!\n- Healthcare professionals across the country use our app to help patients save money\n- Featured by: The New York Times, PBS, ABC News, Forbes, CNN, Good Morning America, The LA Times, & more!\n\nMedical Refill Reminders & Medication Tracker\n- Meds reminder: Get alerts with our medication reminder\n- Medicine tracker: Manage medications with our free drug guide and pill tracker\n\nTelehealth & My Health Care Tool\n- Medication list and drug guide\n- Pill tracker for daily prescriptions & medications\n- Virtual care with online medical professionals\n- Find doctor care without Medicare, Medicaid, or medical insurance\n- Understand your medication list & prescriptions\n- Prescription delivery & pickup\n\nGoodRx Care services include\n- Weight Loss management with GLP-1 medications like Ozempic, Mounjaro, Wegovy, and Zepbound\n- Medical refills on birth control\n- UTI: Urinary Tract Infection\n- ED: Erectile Dysfunction\n- Hair Loss\n- Short term medication refills\n\nGoodRx Care Direct is a program that offers subscription access to telehealth visits and prescriptions (if deemed medically appropriate by the treating healthcare provider), along with other products and services. You are obligated to pay for all services provided. Weight loss treatment via GoodRx Care Direct is not available in Alabama or Louisiana at this time. Additional information about GoodRx Care Direct can be obtained by calling (855) 526-3318 or by visiting our full GoodRx Care Direct Terms of Service.\n\nYour GoodRx Care Direct subscription plan will automatically renew and continue in accordance with your plan type and be charged to your payment method on file. You can cancel anytime by visiting the treatment plan page from your account dashboard and selecting \"Cancel\" at least one day before your subscription plan renews to avoid future charges.\n\nBy downloading GoodRx, you agree to be bound by our Terms Of Use. Read more at http://www.goodrx.com/terms-of-use.\n\nPlease visit https://www.goodrx.com/about/privacy-policy to read our Privacy Policy for additional information about our handling of personal data.", "trackCensoredName":"GoodRx: Prescription Savings", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/goodrx-prescription-savings/id485357017?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "averageUserRating":4.84086999999999978427922542323358356952667236328125, "artistId":485357020, "artistName":"GoodRx", "releaseDate":"2011-12-07T20:47:44Z", "bundleId":"com.goodrx.iphone", "userRatingCount":703560}, 
